Package: tigervnc-wws-viewer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: TigerVNC viewer for the WWS
 The TigerVNC viewer of the wws branch: VNC File Drop (files dragged onto
 the viewer window are uploaded to the VNC session through the side channel
 the server announces), VNC Device Link (serial ports, network devices and
 files of this computer for the remote desktop) and X.509 client
 certificates.  Installed as tigervnc-wws-viewer next to the viewer of the
 distribution.
